From 7e550931ea50604e61f741ef860be0ac129dac7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Panteleev <git@cy.md>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:28:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(microsoft): Graph calendar: meetings' attendees,
 organizer, answer, HTML body and online meeting

An event keeps its body's content type, showAs and attendees as given, and
isOnlineMeeting gives it an onlineMeeting.joinUrl. What Graph sets itself
of a meeting someone else organizes (organizer, responseStatus,
isCancelled), the emulator takes too, to seed one; events have a webLink.
